{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53681","headline":"偈 · 齐安和尚","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猛炽焰中人有路，旋风顶上屹然栖。\n；镇常历劫谁差互，杲日无言运照齐。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷十、《五灯会元》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐安和尚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53681.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53681","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}